# Evidence stays out of git (CLAUDE.md). Old pool worktrees still hold untracked copies of the
# data that the 2026-10-21 history cleanup removed from docs/audits/velocity-implementation; keep
# a broad `git add` there from committing them again. The directory's notes and scripts stay tracked.
docs/audits/velocity-implementation/**/*.json
